# Normalise line endings to LF for everyone, regardless of core.autocrlf.
# Prettier, ESLint and the CI (Linux) all expect LF; without this a Windows
# checkout writes CRLF and `npm run format:check` fails locally.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
